# Netlify SPA Redirect Rules — GoldFlow NFC
# Explicit forced rewrites (200!) for QR Code and NFC routes
# This guarantees mobile phone cameras scanning /q/:slug never hit Netlify's 404
/q/*    /index.html   200!
/qr/*   /index.html   200!
/r/*    /index.html   200!

# SPA catch-all rewrite
/*      /index.html   200
